{%- comment -%}
  LUMORA PDP INGREDIENTS, DECODED  ·  lu-pdp-decoded.liquid  (mockup section 3)
  Paste into: Long Light product template > Add section > Custom Liquid (padding 0), after Why amber.
  Linen. The two actives with their real percentages and "why this %", the other thirteen in label order
  (the INCI matches the rendered back label word for word), then "Formulated without, and why".
  Static copy for Long Light; the mockup's metaobject version is optional (BUILD-GUIDE 6.4).
{%- endcomment -%}
<section id="ingredients" class="lu-sec lu-s-linen lu-pdp-decoded" aria-labelledby="decoded-title">
  <div class="container-fluid">
    <header class="lu-head lu-head--row">
      <div class="lu-head__text">
        <p class="lu-eyebrow">Ingredients, decoded</p>
        <h2 id="decoded-title" class="lu-h2">Every ingredient, and its <em>job.</em></h2>
        <p class="lu-lead">Two actives do the visible work. The other thirteen keep them stable, comfortable and easy to wear, listed here in label order with what each one is for.</p>
      </div>
    </header>
    <div class="lu-pdp-heroes">
      <article class="lu-pdp-hero-ingr">
        <div class="lu-media lu-r45"><img src="{{ 'lu-ingredient-vitamin-c.jpg' | file_img_url: '600x' }}" loading="lazy" alt="Golden drops of serum backlit by warm light"></div>
        <div class="lu-pdp-hero-ingr__text">
          <p class="lu-pdp-hero-ingr__pct lu-tnum">10%</p>
          <h3>Vitamin C</h3>
          <p class="lu-pdp-inci">3-O-Ethyl Ascorbic Acid</p>
          <p>Brightens the look of dull skin and evens the look of tone. A stable, water-loving form of vitamin C that stays potent in a water-light serum.</p>
          <p class="lu-pdp-why"><b>Why 10%</b>Enough to see by week <span class="lu-nowrap">four<sup class="lu-fn" data-fn="2">2</sup>,</span> gentle enough to use twice a day.</p>
        </div>
      </article>
      <article class="lu-pdp-hero-ingr">
        <div class="lu-media lu-r45"><img src="{{ 'lu-ingredient-sea-buckthorn.jpg' | file_img_url: '600x' }}" loading="lazy" alt="Orange sea buckthorn berries on the branch, backlit"></div>
        <div class="lu-pdp-hero-ingr__text">
          <p class="lu-pdp-hero-ingr__pct lu-tnum">2%</p>
          <h3>Sea buckthorn oil</h3>
          <p class="lu-pdp-inci">Hippophae Rhamnoides Fruit Oil</p>
          <p>Pressed from the fruit and rich in carotenoids. It is the reason Long Light is apricot: the color is the ingredient, so there are no dyes.</p>
          <p class="lu-pdp-why"><b>Why 2%</b>Enough for the carotenoids, low enough to sink in clear.</p>
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>
    <div class="lu-pdp-inci-list">
      <p class="lu-pdp-inci-list__title">The other thirteen, in label order</p>
      <ol>
        <li><b>Water</b><span class="lu-pdp-inci">Aqua · solvent</span><p>The base the serum is built on.</p><em>Base</em></li>
        <li><b>Propanediol</b><span class="lu-pdp-inci">Humectant</span><p>From corn sugar. Keeps the serum fluid and helps the vitamin C dissolve.</p><em>Base</em></li>
        <li><b>Glycerin</b><span class="lu-pdp-inci">Humectant</span><p>Helps skin hold on to water, so it feels soft, never tight.</p><em>Base</em></li>
        <li><b>Squalane</b><span class="lu-pdp-inci">Emollient</span><p>From olives. A weightless lipid that keeps skin feeling soft.</p><em class="lu-tnum">1%</em></li>
        <li><b>Solubilizer</b><span class="lu-pdp-inci">Polyglyceryl-4 Caprate</span><p>Lets the oil and water mix, so the serum stays water-light.</p><em>Helper</em></li>
        <li><b>Hyaluronic acid</b><span class="lu-pdp-inci">Sodium Hyaluronate · humectant</span><p>Holds water at the surface for a soft, comfortable feel.</p><em>Under 1%</em></li>
        <li><b>Vitamin E</b><span class="lu-pdp-inci">Tocopherol · antioxidant</span><p>Helps keep the oils fresh.</p><em class="lu-tnum">0.5%</em></li>
        <li><b>Ferulic acid</b><span class="lu-pdp-inci">Antioxidant</span><p>Works with vitamins C and E to help keep the formula stable.</p><em class="lu-tnum">0.5%</em></li>
        <li><b>Xanthan gum</b><span class="lu-pdp-inci">Thickener</span><p>A touch of body, so each drop stays where you put it.</p><em>Helper</em></li>
        <li><b>Sodium phytate</b><span class="lu-pdp-inci">Chelating agent</span><p>Binds the trace minerals in water that would dull the formula.</p><em>Helper</em></li>
        <li><b>Citric acid</b><span class="lu-pdp-inci">Buffer</span><p>Sets the pH where this form of vitamin C is most comfortable.</p><em>Helper</em></li>
        <li><b>Phenoxyethanol</b><span class="lu-pdp-inci">Preservative</span><p>The preservative, so the serum stays fresh for six months once open.</p><em>Under 1%</em></li>
        <li><b>Ethylhexylglycerin</b><span class="lu-pdp-inci">Preservative helper</span><p>Supports the preservative, so less of it is needed.</p><em>Helper</em></li>
      </ol>
    </div>
    <div class="lu-pdp-without">
      <p class="lu-pdp-without__title">Formulated without, and why</p>
      <ul>
        <li><b>Fragrance and essential oils</b>Some skin reacts to them, and the serum has nothing to mask.</li>
        <li><b>Mica and glitter</b>The glow should be your skin’s, not a coating.</li>
        <li><b>Dyes</b>The color comes from sea buckthorn, so there is nothing to add.</li>
        <li><b>Drying alcohols</b>They can leave skin feeling tight after a few minutes.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
<style>
.lu-pdp-heroes{display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 24px;}
.lu-pdp-hero-ingr{display: grid; grid-template-columns: 200px 1fr; gap: 28px; align-items: start; padding: 20px 28px 20px 20px; border-radius: var(--lu-radius); background: var(--lu-travertine);}
.lu-pdp-hero-ingr__pct{font: 300 76px/.9 var(--lu-display); letter-spacing: -.035em;}
.lu-pdp-hero-ingr h3{margin-top: 14px; font: 400 24px/1.15 var(--lu-display); letter-spacing: -.01em;}
.lu-pdp-inci{display: block; margin-top: 5px; font: 600 10.5px/15px var(--lu-body); letter-spacing: .12em; text-transform: uppercase; color: rgb(var(--color-price-sale));}
.lu-pdp-hero-ingr__text > p:not([class]){margin-top: 12px; font-size: 15px; line-height: 23px; color: rgb(var(--color-foreground-secondary));}
.lu-pdp-why{margin-top: 14px; padding-top: 12px; border-top: 1px solid rgb(var(--color-border)); font-size: 14px; line-height: 21px;}
.lu-pdp-why b{display: block; margin-bottom: 2px; font: 600 11px/16px var(--lu-body); letter-spacing: .16em; text-transform: uppercase; color: rgb(var(--color-price-sale));}
.lu-pdp-inci-list{margin-top: 64px;}
.lu-pdp-inci-list__title, .lu-pdp-without__title, .lu-pdp-layering__title{font: 300 30px/1.2 var(--lu-display); letter-spacing: -.015em;}
.lu-pdp-inci-list__title{padding-bottom: 18px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(var(--color-border));}
.lu-pdp-inci-list ol{display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; grid-template-rows: repeat(7, auto); grid-auto-flow: column; column-gap: 56px;}
.lu-pdp-inci-list li{display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr auto; column-gap: 20px; align-items: center; padding: 14px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(var(--color-border));}
.lu-pdp-inci-list li b{grid-column: 1; font: 400 18px/1.3 var(--lu-display);}
.lu-pdp-inci-list li .lu-pdp-inci{grid-column: 1; margin-top: 2px;}
.lu-pdp-inci-list li p{grid-column: 1; margin-top: 4px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 21px; color: rgb(var(--color-foreground-secondary));}
.lu-pdp-inci-list li em{grid-column: 2; grid-row: 1 / span 3; padding: 7px 12px; border-radius: var(--lu-pill); background: var(--lu-travertine); font: 600 12.5px/1 var(--lu-body); font-style: normal; white-space: nowrap;}
.lu-pdp-without, .lu-pdp-layering{display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(12, 1fr); column-gap: 24px; margin-top: 56px; padding-top: 30px; border-top: 1px solid rgb(var(--color-border));}
.lu-pdp-without__title, .lu-pdp-layering__title{grid-column: 1 / span 3;}
.lu-pdp-without ul, .lu-pdp-layering dl{grid-column: 4 / span 9; display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); gap: 22px 24px;}
.lu-pdp-without li{font-size: 14px; line-height: 21px; color: rgb(var(--color-foreground-secondary));}
.lu-pdp-without li b{display: block; margin-bottom: 4px; font: 400 17px/1.25 var(--lu-display); color: rgb(var(--color-foreground));}
@media (max-width: 767px){
.lu-pdp-heroes{grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 16px;}
.lu-pdp-hero-ingr{grid-template-columns: 112px 1fr; gap: 16px; padding: 14px 16px 16px 14px;}
.lu-pdp-hero-ingr__pct{font-size: 52px;}
.lu-pdp-hero-ingr h3{margin-top: 10px; font-size: 21px;}
.lu-pdp-hero-ingr__text > p:not([class]){font-size: 14px; line-height: 21px;}
.lu-pdp-why{font-size: 13.5px; line-height: 20px;}
.lu-pdp-inci-list{margin-top: 44px;}
.lu-pdp-inci-list__title, .lu-pdp-without__title, .lu-pdp-layering__title{font-size: 24px;}
.lu-pdp-inci-list ol{grid-template-columns: 1fr; grid-template-rows: none; grid-auto-flow: row;}
.lu-pdp-inci-list li b{font-size: 17px;}
.lu-pdp-inci-list li p{font-size: 13.5px; line-height: 20px;}
.lu-pdp-without, .lu-pdp-layering{display: block; margin-top: 40px; padding-top: 24px;}
.lu-pdp-without ul, .lu-pdp-layering dl{grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 18px 16px; margin-top: 18px;}
}
.lu-pdp-decoded ol,.lu-pdp-decoded ul{list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0}
</style>
